= AI agent — Simple =

An '''AI agent''' is an AI-powered system that can work through a task by choosing and taking actions.

A modern agent might:

* receive a goal;
* make a plan;
* use tools;
* remember useful information;
* check what happened;
* take another action.

The AI model is only one part of the whole system.

A chatbot that only answers one message is not automatically an agent.

An agent also does not need complete freedom. It can work inside limits or ask a person for approval.

